      "content": "idk i just dont really want to spend 4 hours in an urgent care waiting room if i dont have to... it feels like a bacterial thing tho. my tonsils look kinda red and there are little white spots on them. if I just take a small dose of the amoxicillin for like 3 days to see if it helps, wouldn't that be better than just waiting and getting sicker?",
